# _KB5v2_STOP_ARR002_GATE11.scn
# Gọi bởi ATDIST khi ARR002 tới gần Gate 11. Khoá cứng vị trí bằng MOVE, sau
# đó PCALL xoá tàu bay sau 10 giây.
00:00:00.00>ARR002 LNAV OFF
00:00:00.00>ARR002 VNAV OFF
00:00:00.00>MOVE ARR002,16.057809,108.201338,0,82.0,0.0
00:00:00.00>PCALL _KB5v2_DEL_AFTER10 ARR002
